<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85768" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πορ-ιστής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῦ</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one who supplies</i> or <i>provides,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τῶν κακῶν τῷ δήμῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					8.48
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύλαξ καὶ π. ἀλλοτρίων χρημάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eus.Mynd.
					24
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόξης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					2.53
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>(
				Comp.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>abs.,
				<i>money-maker,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				19.2.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> pl., at
			Athens, <i>a financial board appointed to raise extraordinary
				supplies,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				1505
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				6.49
			</span></i>, etc.: hence metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν χρημάτων αὐτοὶ ταμίαι καὶ π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					4.33
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> the name used
			by robbers of themselves, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ λῃσταὶ αὑτοὺς ποριστὰς καλοῦσι
					νῦν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1405a26
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
